    "isEquipped": false,
    "description": "You make yourself less of a presence on the battlefield, gaining the 'Sneak' status effect. While Sneaking, enemies will not target you unless there are no other valid targets in their range. You may move through hostile units, and they may move through you as well.\n\nThis effect persists until you take a hostile action or become the target of a hostile action. Using this ability again while sneaking will also end the effect.",
